    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAPE FROM THE SHADOWS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >run and fight against an assortment of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/4a8d694d3e3b71a40ee2b53f322239a7.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/4a8d694d3e3b71a40ee2b53f322239a7.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/4a8d694d3e3b71a40ee2b53f322239a7.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASH THE DARKNESS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flashlight and every light you've got in hand to defeat the shadows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/d2fe08bd275612c366d575558c8f21c8.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/d2fe08bd275612c366d575558c8f21c8.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/d2fe08bd275612c366d575558c8f21c8.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WATCH OUT FOR TRAPS\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the enemy's traps or the battle will be more difficult</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T LOSE YOUR HEAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you lose your sanity you better have quick feet to run away from the monsters before they get you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP THE LIGHTS ON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the dark trap your house; turn the lights on, or face the consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/066c547d975c40ed1c9f47f79701e95b.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/066c547d975c40ed1c9f47f79701e95b.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/066c547d975c40ed1c9f47f79701e95b.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
