_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/7e631be29098cac778d07154631eac33.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T LOSE YOUR HEAD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if you lose your sanity you better have quick feet to run away from the monsters before they get you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.webm?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/38287c69b339ac45635343c10a2302b7.mp4?t=1753230189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP THE LIGHTS ON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the dark trap your house; turn the lights on, or face the consequences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/066c547d975c40ed1c9f47f79701e95b.poster.avif?t=1753230189\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641980/extras/066c547d975c4